  <article class="prose-dolphin max-w-none">

    <p>
      The DMPX-028 is a Dolphin-engineered turnkey module class supplied with a remanufactured Alfa Laval MOPX 207 or WHPX 407 centrifuge. These are distinct base machines with different published capacity records, so the selected base-machine identity stays attached to every flow value.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">Dolphin is an independent remanufacturer and is not affiliated with Alfa Laval.</p>

    <!-- Product Image -->
    <figure class="text-center my-8">
      <img
        src="/images/alfa-laval-mopx-207-centrifuge/Alfa-Laval-MOPX207-Used-Oil-Centrifuge-600.webp"
        alt="Alfa Laval MOPX 207 used oil centrifuge, supplied by Dolphin as the DMPX-028 system"
        width="600"
        height="600"
        loading="lazy"
        class="rounded-lg shadow-lg img-cap-600 mx-auto"
      />
      <figcaption class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">
        Alfa Laval MOPX 207, supplied by Dolphin as the DMPX-028 mid-range self-cleaning 3-phase disc stack centrifuge
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <!-- Technical Specifications -->
    <h2 id="technical-specifications">Technical Specifications</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Parameter</th>
            <th>DMPX-028 Value</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Base-machine options</td><td>Alfa Laval MOPX 207 or WHPX 407 (remanufactured)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Diesel capacity, MOPX 207</td><td>5,000 L/h (22.01 US GPM derived), 40&deg;C, 13 cSt</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Diesel capacity, WHPX 407</td><td>6,000 L/h (26.42 US GPM derived), 40&deg;C, 13 cSt</td></tr>
          <tr><td>WHPX 407 rated reference</td><td>9,000 L/h (39.63 US GPM derived); source fluid unspecified, not a diesel or water capacity</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Bowl Sludge Capacity</td><td>1.03 gallons</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Bowl Speed</td><td>6,325–7,125 RPM</td></tr>
          <tr><td>G-Force</td><td>7,000–7,800</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Motor Power</td><td>7.5–10 HP</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Voltages</td><td>230 / 460 V, 3-Phase</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Net Weight (Bare Centrifuge)</td><td>~1,800 lbs</td></tr>
